        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwangwachiyda geaka gajeami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaanyaschi uurda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gooruutanean jarooda, aba guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghwayiinan ng'eanyi, aba bugusta moangoachi nea ghwanyiit geaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goosiigan murdeeda bea meadajeega sean, ng'ula, gwanda geaka saang'a moangoachiydida, ak ea gajeami muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoanyaashan nea gwayi, “Ea orjeeda siida, geaksu gayghwanyas eaweega?” Hean ghaashaayi ak geayeeshi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ginali ang'iing'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean gicha, “Ramoorsiina geaksu nea giyeeshi, ‘Ea geaka gajeami, ooleeysiiniit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA geaksu ng'asheesu. Ng'ula gaydayiin giisiimeanda jeedeang'wa ak gajanyasa eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydayiin geaka sasanuukeagwa, nea ghaayiinyi banyeega sasanuukeagwa, nea geedukutaneegwa aba mughoowooda ak geaguuseegwa giisiimeanda ak abeeda gajanyasa eaweega, ak gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gearamoorji aba gisirukusiindanean, nea aba damandida earamoorsiin, ghwahidu nyeashta haw, ea sawooda ng'eanyiida. Hean goosiipsiinyi geakiga, nea gaba nih asiipsa nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghaang'weardi ghaadaayi geakiga siyiin geepkeega ea banyeega ak geedukuta aba muunda, ak ea mandeawana giisiimeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean, “Ea orjeeda siida, ramoora, ramoorsiina jeameeda, ak giyeeshi jeameeda gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, beeni nea gileabu meadajeega asang'wan bea ng'eanyiida. Ea giisiimeanda guusiina suh ghayi sibwariin ak ghwanyas eaweega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gearamoorsi gawuurji gidarukuteayda, ak gaba nih nyas giisiimeanda ea eaweega. Ak ghamiinaada aba geeshanga nyaawa lugooda saang'a muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean, “Ea orjeeda siida, geaksu fuga sean bea Israeli gil. Ng'ula, saawa gwayi, ‘geakaasa nigajeamiidi gidasirarji mudu gwanda ak ea siisheali.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ramoora nea giyeeshi saawa, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA; Ng'ula, gaydajaat bung'eadingeagwa, ak gaydeaduuneegwa aba jeeda bung'eadingeagwa; Ea fugeasu, ak gaydanung' aweayeena jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, inyeessa ghaajaachi bung'eadingeagwa ak gearuunaneegwa jeeda bung'eadingeagwa, Ea fugeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydayiin gurooroodeanyu jeedeang'wa, ak gajanyasa eaweega, ak gaydayiineegwa jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa. Ak gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA neargu ng'asheesu ak ea neasinyi, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda ea Israeli goombal sugoocheanjagi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan gicha ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi, “Ea orjeeda siida, geani ng'archeanda ak ging'oorsi badaydaanyi ng'asheesu. ‘Sugoocheanda Yuda, ak gigeanu ng'archeanda nuut ak ging'oorsi ng'asheesu, Sugoocheanda Israeli’; ak gigeanu ng'archeanda nuut ak ging'waari ‘Yosefu (bileangida Efraimu)’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata gigeanu aguuyeena duwaawi ghoah ng'archeanjagi, ak ghoah akaleala aba geatindaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyas gwayeeshiineey fugaagu, ‘gideabeedeaba ng'asheesu isiniin mayrukuneasa?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda giyeeshi saawa, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, gaydageanu ng'archeanda meatkweeda Israeli, ak ghaayiinyi hijagi sea dea mida meatkweeda Yuda. Suh asiyeenyean gaydanung' ghoah ng'archeanjagi aba geatindeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'aritka ing'waari badahuuka gaygwanda geatindaang'u aba madeenyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giyeeshi saawa, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, gaydearuuna fuga Israeli jeeda eemoojiga ghayi weay jeeda. Ak gaydaaweamna meadajeega sean, ak gaydeadu jeeda ng'eanyiida nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghoah saawa eemeanagi aba ng'eanyiida, aba jeeda giijeega Israeli ak sugoocheanda nyaawa gajea agi, ak ea maygut ghoah gicha eemooji iyeenya, nea maygut gwaheeli ghoah sugoodi iyeenya ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea maygut ghang'uda geat ririnnyeanda aba sanaamajeega nyaawa, ghana aba haleanjeeda nyaawa munyas, ghana aba giidiinyeanyeeka nyaawa wassean. Ak gaydalealu nea gearuuni heeda abiita sean, ghayi sin riing'eeda aba jeedida, ak gaydaamiidu asi gayghoah fugeasu nea gaydoaw ASEETA nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda siideanyu bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi gayghoah sugoocheanda nyaawa. Ak jeagiischoocheanda nyaawa gajea agi, ak gayghwaat geeshta hamurajeegeasu, nea ghoang'waay deaweedajeegeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoobiida ng'eanyiida ghayi aadawji Yakobo was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda, heeda ghayi abiita ghweanigeagwa. Ak eara saawa gaygoobiida hoowa, saawa ea diibiga nyaawa ea diibiga gea nyaawa, damanda manda muudeanooda. Ak Dawdi was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda gayghoah siida nyaawa haw damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydasin neajeeda hoyyoo sea saawa, gayghoah neajeeda manda muudeanooda sea saawa. Ak gaydaadaw ghawooda nea ghaanung' ghwasaang'ayiit nea heedeanyu ghaydit gaydayiin bugusta nyaawa damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
